OL,3,GNEWSAUpset and confusion over care home
OL,4,Aclosure plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters of a care home that has been
OL,7,Fearmarked for closure by a local
OL,8,Fauthority say the proposals make no
OL,9,Fsense and are affecting the wellbeing
OL,10,Fof residents.
OL,12,FDescribed in a petition to save it as
OL,13,Fan "integral part of the community",
OL,14,FHenry Cornish Care Centre in Chipping
OL,15,FNorton has been identified for
OL,16,Fpotential closure after a review into
OL,17,FOxfordshire's future care needs.
OL,19,FThe county council said more money was
OL,20,Fneeded to support "higher-level care
OL,21,Fprovision, including beds for residents
OL,22,Fliving with dementia".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
